# Scratch checkouts created when a coding agent works in an isolated git
# worktree. Transient, and each one is a full copy of the repo -- the pair
# running when this line was added came to 727 MB. Never commit them.
# Anything else under .claude/ (project skills, settings) is NOT ignored,
# so it can still be tracked deliberately.
.claude/worktrees/
